    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Doran Estates are delighted to present to the market this excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-proportioned five-bedroom semi-detached home, complete with a garage and ideally positioned in a highly sought-after residential neighbourhood.\r\nExtending to approximately 130 sq.m. (1,399 sq.ft.), the property offers generous accommodation throughout, together with a south-west facing rear garden and an open green area to the front.\r\nOn entering through the entrance porch, you are welcomed by a spacious hallway with useful under-stairs storage. To the left are two interconnected reception rooms, providing flexible living space. The kitchen is well equipped with an excellent range of storage units and integrated appliances. From the kitchen, there is access to a separate utility room, which has a door leading directly to the rear garden, as well as a convenient guest WC.\r\nUpstairs, the property provides five well-proportioned bedrooms, comprising four double bedrooms and one single bedroom. Three of the bedrooms overlook the front of the property, while two enjoy views towards the rear garden. The accommodation on this level is completed by a fully tiled main bathroom with a bath, together with a separate shower room.\r\nOutside, the south-west facing rear garden offers a good level of outdoor space and features a concrete garden shed. To the front, there is off-street parking, while the property also benefits from a garage.\r\nThe location is particularly convenient, with a wide range of schools, shops, sporting facilities and recreational amenities all within easy reach. Nearby facilities include Castleknock Golf and Country Club, St. Brigid's GAA Club, Castleknock Lawn Tennis Club, Blanchardstown and Roselawn Shopping Centres, while the Phoenix Park is also close by and provides extensive opportunities for outdoor recreation.\r\nThe area is well served by public transport, with regular Dublin Bus services available locally and Coolmine Train Station approximately a 15-minute walk away. The M50 is also just a few minutes' drive from the property, providing convenient access to Dublin and the wider national road network.\r\nThis is a substantial home offering well-planned accommodation, useful outdoor space and excellent connectivity to the surrounding area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch: \r\nWelcoming porch with doors to garage\r\nHallway: \r\nEntrance hallway with laminated floors, under-stairs storage\r\nLiving Room: (4.05m x 3.57m)\r\nLarge living room with laminated floors, fireplace\r\nSitting Room: (3.85m x 3.57m)\r\nSitting room with laminated floors\r\nKitchen: (4.90m x 2.85m)\r\nLaminated floor with tiled splashback, kitchen units with wall and floor storage \r\nUtillity Room: (2.45m x 1.60m)\r\nLaminated floor , guest WC, access to back garden \r\nBedroom 1: (3.80m x 2.97m)\r\nDouble bedroom with laminated floor \r\nBedroom 2: (4.00m x 3.10m)\r\nDouble bedroom with laminated floor \r\nBedroom 3: (2.90m x 2.40m)\r\nDouble bedroom with laminated floor\r\nBedroom 4: (4.90m x 2.30m)\r\nDouble bedroom with laminated floor \r\nBedroom 5: (2.30m x 2.00m)\r\nSingle bedroom with laminated floor \r\nBathroom: (2.40m x 1.65m)\r\nBathroom with tiled floor and tiled walls, bath with shower attachment, whb, WC. \r\nShower Room: (1.30m x 0.80m)\r\nShower Room with tiled floor and tiled walls \r\nOutside:\r\nBack: Garden (approx. 14.60m x 9.50m) a south-west facing rear garden with garden shed\r\nFront: Off-street parking \r\nPlease note that Doran Estates have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services and cannot verify their working condition or provide any warranty in relation thereto. Interested parties are strongly advised to carry out their own inspections and satisfy themselves regarding the condition and functionality of all items prior to the completion of the sale. Floor plans are provided for illustrative purposes only; all measurements are approximate and may not be to scale. Photographs are for guidance only and may not represent the current state of the property. Doran Estates would recommend that all purchaser carry out a full and detailed inspection of the property themselves as well as engaging a surveyor to carryout an inspection on their behalf."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Approx. 130 sq.m. / 1,399 sq.ft.\r\nFive generous bedrooms (4 doubles, 1 single)\r\nGarage with additional off-street parking\r\nSouth-west facing rear garden\r\nTwo spacious reception rooms\r\nSeparate utility room & guest WC\r\nMain bathroom and separate shower room\r\nWalking distance to Coolmine Train Station\r\nClose to Phoenix Park, M50 and excellent local amenities"
      },
